<title>SWITZERLAND: Schindler details H1 operating results.</title>
<headline>Schindler details H1 operating results.</headline>
<dateline>LUZERNE, Switzerland 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schindler Holding AG gave these figures for first half operating income in the period ending on June 30:</p>
<p>				   (in millions of Swiss francs)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995 (rev)*</p>
<p> Elevators and escalators		 2,034	 2,002</p>
<p> Rolling stock				  116	   125</p>
<p> ALSO					     259	   207</p>
<p> Group total				  2,409	 2,334</p>
<p> Orders received as of June 30	   1996	  1995</p>
<p> Elevators and rolling stock	    2,106	 2,210</p>
<p> Rolling stock				   17	    27</p>
<p> ALSO					     261	   207</p>
<p> Group total				  2,384	 2,444</p>
<p> Orders received as of		 July 2, 1996   June 30, 1995</p>
<p> Elevators and rolling stock	    2,106	 2,210</p>
<p> Rolling stock				  264	    27</p>
<p> ALSO					     261	   207</p>
<p> Group total				  2,631	 2,444</p>
<p>* - The comparative operating income figures for the first half of 1995 were adjusted to reflect an extra 152 million francs in consolidated income from elevators and escalators that was originally excluded because the letter to shareholders was sent out several weeks earlier than usual last year. -- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
